OL,3,ABulgaria summons Russian ambassador
OL,4,Aafter ship sinks in Black Sea drone
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FBulgarian Prime Minister Rumen Radev
OL,8,Fhas summoned the Russian ambassador
OL,9,Fafter two merchant ships were struck by
OL,10,Fdrones off Bulgaria's Black Sea coast
OL,11,Fand one of them sank.
OL,13,FSix crew members on the
OL,14,FGuinea-Bissau-flagged HS Dignity were
OL,15,Frescued and 10 others are missing,
OL,16,Faccording to Defence Minister Dimitar
OL,17,FStoyanov, after it went down 17
OL,18,Fnautical miles (31km) east of the
OL,19,Fvillage of Krapets having sent a
OL,20,Fdistress signal.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
