OL,3,ABulgaria summons Russian ambassador
OL,4,Aafter ship sinks in Black Sea drone
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe other ship, the Ukrainian owned
OL,8,FChelsea-3, was hit by drones 18
OL,9,Fnautical miles from the town of Byala
OL,10,Fand all 15 crew were rescued.
OL,12,FThe attacks come a week after two other
OL,13,Fcommercial ships were hit by sea and
OL,14,Faerial drones in Bulgaria's exclusive
OL,15,Feconomic zone.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
